    <li><a href="https://www.irs.gov/taxtopics/tc751" rel="noopener">IRS — Topic no. 751, Social Security and Medicare withholding rates</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.irs.gov/forms-pubs/about-publication-15-t" rel="noopener">IRS — Publication 15-T, Federal Income Tax Withholding Methods</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/consumer-tools/managing-someone-elses-money/" rel="noopener">Consumer Financial Protection Bureau — understanding your pay</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>See the <a href="/methodology/">Methodology &amp; Sources</a> page for the exact tables used in the calculators.</p>
</GuideLayout>
